"""Holidays, celebrations, rituals and calendar time -> slightly negative activation.

The component's strongest responses are negative spikes (about -0.5 to -1.0) on words for
celebrations, festivals, holidays, ceremonies and calendar time. Most other tokens have
activations near zero, so the prediction is scaled down by STRENGTH.
