"""Approximate the component's document-opening and boundary responses.

Conversation-start markers and initial role labels receive large positives.
Other chat, tool, and thinking boundaries use smooth position-dependent
responses. End markers are positive after tool closing tags; prose endings
become negative away from the opening, with a remembered-role adjustment.
The package token is especially positive at document start. Opening namespace,
import, and using tokens also get positive responses. All other tokens receive
only a small positional baseline, omitting word-specific fluctuations.
