"""Indefinite-article follower detector (v3).

The component reads the word right after an indefinite article ("a" / "an").
- A plain English noun or adjective after the article (" a problem", " an idea"): strongly positive.
- A capitalised word (" A Test"): weakly positive.
- Function words after the article ("a and", "a is", "a la"): negative.
- Punctuation, math symbols, single letters (a variable "a = ...", "a, b"): negative.
- A bare word fragment with no space (the "a" is the start of a longer word, "a"+"theros"): negative.
"""
